{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15243060","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15243060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1524306001:0":{"text":"Hurry up! The bugs are moving your way!","source_cn":"快，快！虫子跑到你那边了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645CA4EB47B2301F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1524306002:1":{"text":"They're too fast! I can't follow them!","source_cn":"它们跑得太快了，我看不清啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3A6926E871D2E59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1524306003:0":{"text":"Where are the monsters? Move! I'll finish them off!","source_cn":"那些怪物在哪里？让开，我来对付它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF6B32220FBAA57B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1524306004:0":{"text":"Huh? M-Monsters? There aren't any around here.","source_cn":"啊？什、什么怪物，有怪物跑过来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27237B4977D579D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1524306005:0":{"text":"... I heard the fields here were infested with needle locusts.","source_cn":"……不是说有针蝗怪物导致的虫灾吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802A00BD8F1B4A0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1524306006:1":{"text":"You're mistaken! These are just the regular bugs. Look, they're all over the ground.","source_cn":"你误会了！农田里的虫灾，只是普通的害虫，没有怪物。喏，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE31E4DE67AFDF038","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1524306007:0":{"text":"These tiny bugs are fast and numerous! It's impossible to catch them by hand, so we turn to Gala for help.","source_cn":"这些虫子体型小、数量多，飞得有快，单靠人力根本抓不完，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6793476FD28259B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1524306008:0":{"text":"Did Gala send you here to help us with magic?","source_cn":"所以我们去找了加拉帮忙。你们是加拉派来处理虫害的魔法师吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44FE1C8A5F3658A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1524306008":{"text":"Did Gala send you here to help us with magic?","source_cn":"所以我们去找了加拉帮忙。你们是加拉派来处理虫害的魔法师吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44FE1C8A5F3658A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1524306009:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_i